00:14:29,879 --> 00:14:30,480
Fine.

301
00:14:31,679 --> 00:14:32,720
If that's the case,

302
00:14:35,320 --> 00:14:36,639
I'll make you experience

303
00:14:36,639 --> 00:14:37,840
the agony of living.

304
00:14:38,159 --> 00:14:39,759
Let's all suffer.

305
00:14:40,519 --> 00:14:41,279
Shen Suhe,

306
00:14:41,960 --> 00:14:43,120
you lunatic!

307
00:14:47,159 --> 00:14:48,840
Wanna know what else

308
00:14:48,840 --> 00:14:49,879
a lunatic can do?

309
00:14:52,240 --> 00:14:53,080
Guess

310
00:14:53,840 --> 00:14:54,919
where

311
00:14:56,159 --> 00:14:57,120
I'll stab next.

312
00:15:09,279 --> 00:15:09,679
Sui'er.

313
00:15:12,279 --> 00:15:14,000
There are many ways to make life worse than death.

314
00:15:14,679 --> 00:15:16,240
There's no need to dirty your hands.

315
00:15:26,159 --> 00:15:27,000
Worse than death?

316
00:15:28,240 --> 00:15:28,679
I'll teach you.

317
00:15:39,559 --> 00:15:41,279
You sent someone to humiliate,

318
00:15:41,600 --> 00:15:42,720
torture General Xiao,

319
00:15:43,960 --> 00:15:45,080
and control him with drugs

320
00:15:45,960 --> 00:15:47,039
to force a confession.

321
00:15:48,559 --> 00:15:49,840
You made the entire army

322
00:15:49,960 --> 00:15:50,919
suffer unjustly,

323
00:15:51,960 --> 00:15:53,240
bearing the stain of treachery.

324
00:15:54,600 --> 00:15:55,440
After the war,

325
00:15:56,120 --> 00:15:57,360
those who survived

326
00:15:57,799 --> 00:15:59,080
were unjustly punished,

327
00:16:00,320 --> 00:16:01,279
and their families

328
00:16:01,679 --> 00:16:02,759
were implicated.

329
00:16:03,919 --> 00:16:05,639
Everything you've done to the border guards,

330
00:16:06,840 --> 00:16:08,440
I'll repay you double.

331
00:16:10,000 --> 00:16:10,840
I'll make you know

332
00:16:12,120 --> 00:16:14,440
what is the real living hell.

333
00:16:21,480 --> 00:16:22,120
Your Highness.

334
00:16:25,000 --> 00:16:25,639
Your Highness.

335
00:16:26,320 --> 00:16:26,799
Your Highness.

336
00:16:27,399 --> 00:16:28,080
Chuchu.

337
00:16:29,960 --> 00:16:31,679
His Majesty hasn't condemned you yet.

338
00:16:32,200 --> 00:16:33,159
How dare you!

339
00:16:33,639 --> 00:16:34,200
What's going on?

340
00:16:36,399 --> 00:16:36,879
Your Majesty,

341
00:16:37,639 --> 00:16:38,360
Consort Chu

342
00:16:38,679 --> 00:16:40,000
has been kneeling outside the hall

343
00:16:40,320 --> 00:16:41,159
for two days and nights,

344
00:16:41,360 --> 00:16:41,879
asking to be imprisoned

345
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:42,639
to accompany Qian.

346
00:16:43,200 --> 00:16:43,679
Today,

347
00:16:43,960 --> 00:16:45,000
I happened to meet His Majesty,

348
00:16:45,639 --> 00:16:46,080
and he

349
00:16:46,519 --> 00:16:47,600
ordered me to bring her here.

350
00:16:48,840 --> 00:16:50,080
Kneeling for two days and nights,

351
00:16:50,720 --> 00:16:51,879
asking to be imprisoned to accompany him?

352
00:16:52,320 --> 00:16:53,639
I didn't expect that

353
00:16:54,519 --> 00:16:55,480
you're so loyal.

354
00:16:57,600 --> 00:16:58,399
Don't be too proud.

355
00:16:58,960 --> 00:17:00,000
When His Majesty makes up his mind,

356
00:17:00,360 --> 00:17:01,480
and His Highness rises again,

357
00:17:01,720 --> 00:17:02,639
he will definitely not let you go.

358
00:17:03,120 --> 00:17:04,240
Rise again?

359
00:17:06,839 --> 00:17:08,720
So you asked to be imprisoned

360
00:17:09,079 --> 00:17:11,440
just to be his secondary consort

361
00:17:11,640 --> 00:17:12,720
after he gets out of jail and rises again?

362
00:17:14,079 --> 00:17:15,799
How dare you do this to her?

363
00:17:16,559 --> 00:17:17,880
I'll report it to His Majesty.

364
00:17:18,240 --> 00:17:19,039
Go ahead.

365
00:17:19,920 --> 00:17:20,680
Warden,

366
00:17:21,240 --> 00:17:23,000
although Ling Chuchu asked to accompany him,

367
00:17:23,960 --> 00:17:25,359
the Second Prince committed

368
00:17:25,480 --> 00:17:26,119
a serious crime.

369
00:17:26,920 --> 00:17:27,759
It's better to

370
00:17:28,000 --> 00:17:29,200
put her in the next cell.

371
00:17:29,559 --> 00:17:30,160
Shen Suhe,

372
00:17:31,480 --> 00:17:32,200
what do you mean?

373
00:17:32,400 --> 00:17:32,839
Remember,

374
00:17:34,160 --> 00:17:35,519
it's a permanent separation.

375
00:17:36,599 --> 00:17:38,279
They must never meet again.

376
00:17:39,039 --> 00:17:39,839
Do it!

377
00:17:41,160 --> 00:17:41,480
Yes, Your Majesty.

378
00:17:48,839 --> 00:17:50,079
My face, my face!

379
00:17:51,079 --> 00:17:51,799
Ling Chuchu,

380
00:17:53,319 --> 00:17:54,880
you'll never be the principal consort.

381
00:17:56,039 --> 00:17:56,640
This cut

382
00:17:57,960 --> 00:17:59,119
is my revenge.

383
00:17:59,759 --> 00:18:00,880
Shen Suhe,

384
00:18:01,519 --> 00:18:02,799
I'll kill you!

385
00:18:09,000 --> 00:18:09,480
Take her away!

386
00:18:10,480 --> 00:18:10,799
Yes.

387
00:18:12,000 --> 00:18:12,359
Remember,

388
00:18:13,519 --> 00:18:14,640
put her in a separate cell.

389
00:18:17,640 --> 00:18:18,200
Jing Zhao,

390
00:18:20,440 --> 00:18:22,039
just forget

391
00:18:22,880 --> 00:18:23,920
what happened in the prison.

392
00:18:24,759 --> 00:18:25,839
If His Majesty asks,

393
00:18:26,720 --> 00:18:28,119
just say it was all my doing.

394
00:18:28,799 --> 00:18:29,160
Understand?

395
00:18:29,960 --> 00:18:30,240
Yes,

396
00:18:30,720 --> 00:18:31,119
Your Majesty.

397
00:18:37,000 --> 00:18:38,839
[Why does Zhao also have the ring?]

398
00:18:40,079 --> 00:18:41,599
[Is it possible that Mu Jinghao]

399
00:18:42,640 --> 00:18:43,920
[is not the one who strangled me?]
